{"stamp":"28cb0729","cost":134,"model":"eleven_v4_turbo","vo":{"etain":"[conversational, curious] En mille neuf cent cinquante-deux, un Britannique, Alastair Pilkington, a une idée étrange : verser le verre... sur du métal liquide. De l'étain.","essais":"[amused] Il lui faut des années d'essais, dans son usine anglaise. Et le procédé ne rapporte vraiment qu'en mille neuf cent soixante.","flotte":"[warm, conversational] L'étain est plus lourd que le verre. Alors le verre flotte. Il s'étale tout seul, et sa surface devient plane... sans que personne n'y touche.","pourquoi":"[curious] Et pourquoi l'étain ? Il reste liquide sur toute la plage où le verre durcit. Et il ne bout pas : il ne s'évapore presque pas."},"settings":{"stability":0.4,"similarity_boost":0.8,"speed":1},"words":{"etain":[{"s":0.147,"e":0.16},{"s":0.2,"e":1.227},{"s":1.44,"e":1.52},{"s":1.6,"e":2.16},{"s":2.32,"e":2.8},{"s":2.88,"e":3.52},{"s":3.68,"e":3.76},{"s":3.84,"e":3.92},{"s":4.04,"e":4.16},{"s":4.28,"e":4.72},{"s":5.2,"e":5.52},{"s":5.6,"e":5.68},{"s":5.76,"e":6.4},{"s":6.507,"e":6.56},{"s":6.64,"e":6.72},{"s":6.8,"e":7.12},{"s":7.2,"e":7.68},{"s":8.16,"e":8.24},{"s":8.32,"e":8.72}],"essais":[{"s":9.12,"e":9.2},{"s":9.28,"e":9.44},{"s":9.493,"e":9.6},{"s":9.76,"e":9.92},{"s":10,"e":10.24},{"s":10.28,"e":10.64},{"s":10.88,"e":10.96},{"s":11.04,"e":11.12},{"s":11.2,"e":11.36},{"s":11.44,"e":12.16},{"s":12.213,"e":12.24},{"s":12.28,"e":12.32},{"s":12.4,"e":12.72},{"s":12.8,"e":12.88},{"s":12.96,"e":13.2},{"s":13.28,"e":13.6},{"s":13.68,"e":13.84},{"s":13.88,"e":15.36}],"flotte":[{"s":15.433,"e":15.76},{"s":15.84,"e":16},{"s":16.08,"e":16.16},{"s":16.2,"e":16.4},{"s":16.48,"e":16.56},{"s":16.6,"e":16.64},{"s":16.72,"e":17.2},{"s":17.307,"e":17.44},{"s":17.52,"e":17.6},{"s":17.64,"e":17.84},{"s":17.88,"e":18.48},{"s":18.587,"e":18.64},{"s":18.693,"e":18.96},{"s":19.04,"e":19.12},{"s":19.2,"e":19.52},{"s":19.627,"e":19.68},{"s":19.72,"e":19.76},{"s":19.84,"e":20.16},{"s":20.24,"e":20.56},{"s":20.84,